    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it isn't enough though. i look at them and all i see is how much struggle they have because of me. i'm constantly exhausted and just... i'm just a source of stress and money problems and sadness. if i weren't here, things would actually be much easier for them. they could just focus on being a kid without having to worry about me or how much i'm struggling.",
