      "role": "user",
      "content": "stepping back isn't enough. i'm talkin about actually being gone. like, if i wasn't in the picture at all, the house would be quieter, there would be less debt, and they wouldn't have to see their parent just... falling apart every day. it feels like the only way to actually stop hurting them is to just not be a part of their life anymore. doesn't that make sense? that it would be a relief for everyone?",
